      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 4. Continuing Validity of Nominations. After a nominee is appointed, the remaining nominations shall be valid for appointment to any vacancy occurring in that commission, board or other public body within six months after their sub mission to the Mayor; provided, however, that the Committee may nominate additional persons to fill any such vacancy, and may renominate persons for any such vacancy occurring more than six months after its prior submission.",
